ibrary conversion.\n\n### Owner scope\nOwner briefing section 9 delegates this internal route decision to MAIN. External submission and outside-project access remain forbidden.\n\n### MAIN native-contract preparation and review rescope (2026-10-02)\nThe concrete final caller is now the official unmodified PalomarSubmission reusable full workflow at65f0154ed776cd26c224254aa57b379137f28b0d with explicit palomar-standard-v1 GitHub-hosted profile. Permit one1800s Sol Ultra preparation/test/local-commit phase on existing PR755 before756 merges. No full build, push, publication or companion modification during this phase; final refresh/publication remains dependent on756. Carry3898s author cost and both reviews, including unresolved5384612101 F1/F2; author ceiling5698s for this phase. Under owner section9 MAIN explicitly admits one additional1800s canonical independent review of the final native-route repair after fresh exact-head CI, without resetting the previous two-review history or overriding any gate.\n",
