+  "body": "### Motivation\n- Complete #766 with the compact Pauli basis game's concrete question law,\n  Boolean verifier, and exact strategy transports from\n  `references/qpbt-paper/08_classical_and_quantum_low_degree_tests.tex:1126-1491`.\n- This PR is stacked on #762 / PR #765 at\n  `b561f86b39aa3f0325e9a304c79742897d63f084` and must merge only after that\n  parent passes its normal gates.\n\n### Description\n- Add the compact Pauli game over the selected `AdmissibleParams` field model,\n  with the full product seed, all 86 ordered edges, and all seven answer\n  constructors, including malformed answers.\n- Prove exact carrier, edge, coordinate, PMF push-forward, answer-shape, gamma,\n  polynomial-condition, Magic Square, and all-branch verifier identities with\n  the registered Pauli basis test.\n- Prove exact game relabeling and value/projectivity transport for every compact\n  strategy, plus symmetric-game, consistency, positive-support commutation, and\n  SPCC equivalences for compact symmetric strategies.\n- Keep the registered game, parent compact files, soundness statements, and\n  quantitative error modules unchanged. No paper-labelled theorem or blueprint\n  `\\leanok` claim is added.\n\n### Statement integrity\n- Paper assumptions: one `AdmissibleParams P`, with its selected finite field,\n  binary encoding, trace map, and self-dual normal basis.\n- Lean assumptions: exactly `AdmissibleParams P`; all internal parameters are\n  specialized to `P.model`, `binaryRepresentation P.model`, and\n  `fixedBinTrace P.model`.\n- Paper domain: the full ambient Pauli seed, the ordered-edge law with 26 loops\n  and both orientations of 30 non-loop edges, and every answer shape.\n- Lean domain: the full finite product/function carrier, the exact 86-element\n  ordered-edge subtype, and an explicit equivalence retaining all seven answer\n  constructors.\n- Paper conclusion: the concrete question law and verifier agree with the Pauli\n  basis test, and relabeling preserves strategy value and SPCC data.\n- Lean conclusion: exact PMF/game/value equalities and exact projectivity,\n  consistency, support-commutation, and SPCC equivalences.\n- Verdict: exact; no extra assumptions, quantifiers, restricted support, or\n  weakened conclusion.\n\n### Bound strength\n- Exact equalities and equivalences only. No estimate or quantitative bound is\n  added or changed, so there is no loss.\n\n### Testing\n- `lake env lean MIPStarRE/QPBT/Palomar/PauliGameBridge.lean`\n- `lake env lean MIPStarRE/QPBT/Palomar/PauliGameStrategyBridge.lean`\n- `lake build MIPStarRE.QPBT.Palomar.PauliGameStrategyBridge`\n- `rg -n \"sorry|axiom\" MIPStarRE/QPBT/Palomar/PauliGame.lean MIPStarRE/QPBT/Palomar/PauliGameBridge.lean MIPStarRE/QPBT/Palomar/PauliGameStrategyBridge.lean`\n- Normal pre-commit hooks passed for all three milestones.\n- Full `lake build` intentionally not run; the packet authorizes focused target\n  builds and leaves canonical full CI to MAIN.\n\n---\nCloses #766\n",
