t MIPStarRE.QPBT.Test.QubitForm\n     3\timport MIPStarRE.QPBT.Test.Completeness\n     4\timport MIPStarRE.QPBT.Test.LowDegreeGameTheorems\n     5\t\n     6\t/-!\n     7\t# Solution\n     8\t\n     9\tThe MIPStarRE-A library itself proves the four registered QPBT headline\n    10\ttheorems.\n    11\t`Challenge.lean` re-declares the statements' definitional closure verbatim\n    12\tunder the same fully-qualified names, so importing the library is the entire\n    13\tsolution; comparator checks that the two environments declare identical\n    14\tstatements.\n    15\t-/\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
